topic: ~water_keywords()

# Demo version (15 Nov): one question, answered at once. The app refreshes $answer every 5 s with the live
# "is the water drinkable" answer (readings + verdict) from the laptop. ^first says the live answer if it is set,
# otherwise the fixed sentence, so Pepper always speaks.

u:({*} [drink drinking drinkable potable safe] {*}) ^first["$answer" "Drinking water needs salinity below one thousand parts per million and a pH between six and a half and eight and a half. Look at the dashboard for this well's live readings."]
